		{
			"id":"523bb4b87d79d691",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# LGL INSPECTOR\n\n> Under the conglomerates’ oppressive regime, individuals attempt to circumvent its monopolistic power through **REVOLUTIONS**.\n> \n> These so-called corporate dissidents are relentlessly pursued and captured in an effort to suppress their mutiny.\n> \n> Inspectors, trained to the highest standards and fiercely loyal to the company, are deployed to hunt down any informal employee-citizens.\n> \n> These detective inspectors are equipped with genetic augmentations and accompanied by a team of information gatherers.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1623,
			"y":1131,
			"width":1345,
			"height":320
		}
